or:rgb(92,11,214);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(111,19,209);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS BRIEF</span></p></section></section></section></section><section id=\"yaodian\" style=\"margin:20px 10px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">01</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌宣布今年夏季向全球搜索用户免费开放AI模式交互式图表功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">02</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌下调Google AI Plus月费至4.99美元并扩容存储空间至400GB</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">03</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">讯飞医疗正式发布星火医疗大模型 V3.5，全面适配国产算力底座</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯光子发布Light AI游戏资产生成平台，打通工业化生产管线</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic正式发布Claude Mythos系列Fable5模型并开启分级过滤机制</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌宣布今年夏季向全球搜索用户免费开放AI模式交互式图表功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3ef1c0b9f024b5ceb8e844b49cb993f6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌官方宣布，此前仅限AI Mode Pro和Ultra订阅用户使用的“AI模式交互式可视化图表”功能，将于今年夏季全面向所有搜索用户免费开放。该技术基于谷歌去年底在Gemini中推出的交互式图像功能，并进一步拓展了交互式模拟与模型能力。用户在搜索特定主题（如足球阵型）时，AI模式不仅能生成可视化图表，还支持用户直接在图表上进行动态手动调节，以直观理解运作原理。此外，系统会在图表下方自动提供深度背景信息与知识延伸。谷歌表示，此举旨在通过“实践操作”降低学习门槛，让全球用户无需支付费用即可利用AI辅助深度探索与理解复杂概念，标志着谷歌搜索在交互式AI应用普及化进程中的重要一步。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌下调Google AI Plus月费至4.99美元并扩容存储空间至400GB</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6142afe7edca818d7c31ba3a72dc38db.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌宣布下调Google AI Plus订阅计划月费，由7.99美元降至4.99美元，并将云端存储空间从200GB翻倍提升至400GB。Gemini AI产品负责人Vikas Kansal表示，该更新将在未来几天内全球上线。Google AI Plus于今年1月推出，面向个人及学生群体，集成Omni Flash视频生成、Google Flow创意工作室及NotebookLM研究助手等功能。此次降价标志着AI订阅服务价格战正式蔓延至美国本土。行业分析认为，谷歌凭借垂直整合与捆绑销售优势压低获客成本，正加速推动人工智能基础设施层走向商品化。在OpenAI与Anthropic筹备上市的背景下，此类竞争红海化将直接考验纯模型厂商的高估值可持续性，行业利润空间面临进一步挤压。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">讯飞医疗正式发布星火医疗大模型 V3.5，全面适配国产算力底座</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a6315d9ca34cd01d8d64b38d0f4ce411.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月9日，讯飞医疗正式发布星火医疗大模型 V3.5。该版本核心亮点在于全面基于全国产算力进行训练，显著提升了模型的自主可控能力。在技术层面，V3.5版本针对临床刚需进行了深度优化，在多模态数据融合、长文本深度推理及循证医疗决策等关键指标上取得实质性进展。模型精准锚定“临床诊疗”与“居民健康管理”两大核心场景，旨在辅助医生处理复杂病历数据、提升诊断精准度，并为患者提供个性化健康建议。此次升级标志着国产医疗 AI 在专业化与高精尖方向的进一步突破，为医疗机构数字化转型提供了更具实战价值的工具，推动 AI 技术在医疗垂类应用中向深水区迈进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯光子发布Light AI游戏资产生成平台，打通工业化生产管线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c06977463055ddfa4f5f844a7efc4eff.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月5日，腾讯光子工作室群在2026腾讯云AI产业应用大会上，首次披露了内部研发4年的Light AI（光子LAP游戏资产智能体）。该平台旨在解决当前AI游戏生产中“单点玩具化”与“协作作坊化”的痛点，通过构建标准化流水线，实现从2D生成到3D资产制作的无缝衔接。Light AI采用“无限画布”节点可视化方式，支持多人协作，并内置“智能中枢”Agent，用户可通过自然语言指令自动拆解任务。平台核心优势在于格式统一、Game Ready资产交付及经验沉淀，能将资产制作周期从周/月压缩至天级别。此外，平台搭载基于光子3A级制作经验的Skill市场，覆盖IP孵化、资产量产及评审等全生命周期。目前，Light AI已开启Early Access内测申请，旨在为独立开发者及中小型团队提供专业级生产力工具，预计数月后正式面</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic正式发布Claude Mythos系列Fable5模型并开启分级过滤机制</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于6月10日正式面向公众推出Claude Mythos系列Fable5模型。该模型此前因网络安全考量仅限内部测试，此次发布引入了分级过滤机制，针对网络安全、生物及化学等敏感领域查询，系统会自动重定向至低阶模型处理。伴随大众版发布，Anthropic向Project Glasswing计划中的约200家全球政企合作伙伴提供无限制的高阶版本。美国政府已建立常态化机制，对该模型进行关键基础设施漏洞识别能力的安全审查。受算力成本激增影响，Fable5收费标准较前代翻倍，Anthropic目前需向xAI支付高额数据中心租赁费用。在行业竞争加剧背景下，Anthropic已提交IPO计划，标志着AI领域商业竞争进入新阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
